            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Michelle Wachob Sealey"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We added 6 ounces more tomato paste and 1/2 cup more Worcestershire sauce and used 1TBSP Valentina Mexican Hot Sauce in place of the Tobasco and Yellow mustard in place of Dijon as this is what we had on hand. Turned out great!",
            "datePublished": "2017-10-05T16:14:55.283Z"
