              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Alyson"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I made this and it was very good. But...3/4 cup Dijon? I only used 2 teaspoons. I believe 3/4 cup would be way too much.",
            "datePublished": "2017-03-13T19:25:38.373Z"
          },
          {
